3. ONE MINIMAL READ-ONLY STORE ADDITION
=======================================

Common-ancestor discovery requires comparing Core's canonical hash at height H
against the explorer's currently-canonical hash at the same H.

Store currently exposes Tip and RollbackTo, but no read method for an older
canonical height.

